  "releaseNotes": "- AudioDecoder: Replaces private FilterLink access with av_buffersink_set_frame_size\n\t\t- DecoderContext: Fixes an issue with PauseOnQueueFull and Data streams\n\t\t- DecoderContext: Extends DemuxerInput with FormatOpt to support per-input FFmpeg options (primarily for plugins)\n\t\t- Config.Demuxer: Enables HTTP reconnect=1 by default to recover from prematurely disconnected streams\n\n\t\t[Breaking Changes]\n\t\t- Config.Demuxer: Removes the default HLS http_persistent=0 override, which was introduced as a workaround for an FFmpeg bug affecting interrupted HLS reads. Applications can still configure this option explicitly",
